WoW SteamOS Installer

Steam VDF handling in wowsteam/vdf.py was adapted from the earlier
WoW Deck Setup 1.6 source, contributed under the project license. The community project
reorganizes that work and adds version selection, separate storage, explicit
ownership, interrupted-transaction recovery, and regression tests.

No third-party runtime packages or proprietary game assets are bundled.
